 "Agarrate de una silla firme o del marco de una puerta.":"Hold on to a sturdy chair or a door frame.","Con una pierna estirada adelante, bajá en una sola pierna lo que puedas.":"With one leg straight out in front, lower on the other leg as far as you can.","Subí empujando con el talón. Hacé todas y cambiá.":"Push up through your heel. Do all the reps and switch.","Bajá hasta donde controles la rodilla.":"Go only as low as you can control your knee.",
 "Pies al ancho de los hombros y rodillas blandas.":"Feet shoulder-width apart and knees soft.","Inhalá mientras subís los brazos al frente hasta la altura de los hombros.":"Breathe in as you raise your arms in front to shoulder height.","Exhalá mientras bajás las manos y flexionás apenas las rodillas.":"Breathe out as you lower your hands and slightly bend your knees.","Exhalá mientras bajás las manos.":"Breathe out as you lower your hands.","Lento y continuo, como si te movieras dentro del agua.":"Slow and continuous, as if moving through water.",
