 "Manos frente al pecho, palmas hacia adelante.":"Hands in front of your chest, palms facing forward.","Exhalá empujando despacio hacia adelante, con el peso hacia adelante.":"Breathe out as you push slowly forward, shifting your weight forward.","Inhalá volviendo las manos al pecho.":"Breathe in as you bring your hands back to your chest.","Empujá con todo el cuerpo, no solo con los brazos.":"Push with your whole body, not just your arms.",
